DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
40522::$$$message_0274_0000_0000$$$::I promised that I would go on a date sometime with Tohsaka.[lr]::
40523::$$$message_0274_0000_0001$$$::The weather is nice, so inviting her today would be good.::
40524::$$$message_0274_0001_0000$$$::"Hey, Tohsaka...wait, she's not here?"[lr]::
40525::$$$message_0274_0001_0001$$$::I loiter by the door, wondering what to do.[lr]::
40526::$$$message_0274_0001_0002$$$::Then...[lr]::
40527::$$$message_0274_0001_0003$$$::"Senpai? She's gone back home."::
40528::$$$message_0274_0002_0000$$$::"Oh, okay... Thanks, Sakura."[lr]::
40529::$$$message_0274_0002_0001$$$::Oh, she went back after eating... I guess we just missed each other. How unlucky.::
40530::$$$message_0274_0003_0000$$$::"Did you need to talk to her about something?"[lr]::
40531::$$$message_0274_0003_0001$$$::"...No, it's nothing.[lr]::
40532::$$$message_0274_0003_0002$$$::Um... I was thinking of settling my debt to Tohsaka."::
40533::$$$message_0274_0004_0000$$$::"Ahh. Could it be that she's borrowing money from you?"[lr]::
40534::$$$message_0274_0004_0001$$$::I can't help but smile at Sakura's absurd response. Even if I were to borrow money from Tohsaka or Sakura, the opposite wouldn't happen.::
40535::$$$message_0274_0005_0000$$$::"...I wonder if she's okay... Hm..."[lr]::
40536::$$$message_0274_0005_0001$$$::I leave behind Sakura, who is tilting her head in confusion, and head to the living room.[lr]::
40537::$$$message_0274_0005_0002$$$::I'll call the Tohsaka house and get in touch with her.::
40538::$$$message_0274_0006_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
40539::$$$message_0274_0006_0001$$$::I can't help but get nervous when I remember that I'm asking her on a date.::
40540::$$$message_0274_0007_0000$$$::"...Hello? This is Tohsaka."[lr]::
40541::$$$message_0274_0007_0001$$$::"D-don't surprise me like that, Tohsaka."[lr]::
40542::$$$message_0274_0007_0002$$$::"...That's also sudden of you, Emiya."::
40543::$$$message_0274_0008_0000$$$::Tohsaka on the other side of the phone sounds somewhat inarticulate.[lr]::
40544::$$$message_0274_0008_0001$$$::Fortunately, there's no one around me, but I can't help but hide the handset and talk stealthily.::
40545::$$$message_0274_0009_0000$$$::"Umm, let's see. Tohsaka, are you free today?"[lr]::
40546::$$$message_0274_0009_0001$$$::"...I guess so."[lr]::
40547::$$$message_0274_0009_0002$$$::"Then, do you wanna go to Shinto? To pay you back."[lr]::
40548::$$$message_0274_0009_0003$$$::"..."::
40549::$$$message_0274_0010_0000$$$::"...Yeah, sure. What time?"[lr]::
40550::$$$message_0274_0010_0001$$$::"Really? Then let's meet at the Shinto station at 11."[lr]::
40551::$$$message_0274_0010_0002$$$::"...Got it... See you, Emiya..."::
40552::$$$message_0274_0011_0000$$$::...Tohsaka accepted the conditions too easily.[lr]::
40553::$$$message_0274_0011_0001$$$::Tohsaka didn't quite sound like her usual self, and I have doubts about the way she accepted it that smoothly, but a promise is a promise.::
40554::$$$message_0274_0012_0000$$$::"I'll be going out."[lr]::
40555::$$$message_0274_0012_0001$$$::"Are you going on a date with Rin?"[lr]::
40556::$$$message_0274_0012_0002$$$::"Hrrk!!!"[lr]::
40557::$$$message_0274_0012_0003$$$::Rider came out of the blue...!::
40558::$$$message_0274_0013_0000$$$::"W-w-were you listening!?"[lr]::
40559::$$$message_0274_0013_0001$$$::"Yes, a little bit. Your tone of voice sounded thrilled, so I figured you were talking to Rin."[lr]::
40560::$$$message_0274_0013_0002$$$::"Hnng... Y-you're right, but what is Saber doing?"::
40561::$$$message_0274_0014_0000$$$::"Saber has returned to her room.[lr]::
40562::$$$message_0274_0014_0001$$$::She borrowed a book from me for once."[lr]::
40563::$$$message_0274_0014_0002$$$::...I see. Then, I guess there's no need to go out of my way to invite her.[lr]::
40564::$$$message_0274_0014_0003$$$::First off, I'm going on a date with Tohsaka.::
40565::$$$message_0274_0015_0000$$$::"Then, take care, Shirou.[lr]::
40566::$$$message_0274_0015_0001$$$::Please do not worry about us. I will let Sakura know that you are going out and will be back by the evening."[lr]::
40567::$$$message_0274_0015_0002$$$::"...Okay, thanks. See you."::
40568::$$$message_0274_0016_0000$$$::"...Hm, I wonder if Tohsaka is running late."[lr]::
40569::$$$message_0274_0016_0001$$$::It's 11 AM.[lr]::
40570::$$$message_0274_0016_0002$$$::It's hard for both of us to get ahold of one another once we're outside.[lr]::
40571::$$$message_0274_0016_0003$$$::I can only wait for Tohsaka to arrive, but I feel the need for cell phones in times like this.::
40572::$$$message_0274_0017_0000$$$::"Well, I guess it can't be helped if Tohsaka is a little late."[lr]::
40573::$$$message_0274_0017_0001$$$::She didn't seem that up for it over the phone, and it's not bad having to wait sometimes.[lr]::
40574::$$$message_0274_0017_0002$$$::I can make our plans for later while I wait.::
40575::$$$message_0274_0018_0000$$$::"Maybe we can watch a movie... [font italic=true]Fate/Zero[font italic=false] and [font italic=true]Tiger Dojo: THE MOVIE[font italic=false], huh? What is that? Are they really showing that?"[lr]::
40576::$$$message_0274_0018_0001$$$::I'll think about what else there is for us to do.[lr]::
40577::$$$message_0274_0018_0002$$$::[fg left=0 textoff=0 index=1000 top=-4 time=200 storage=012a_モールスナップ][fg textoff=0 left=453 index=2000 top=24 time=200 storage=012c_ファンシースナップ][fg textoff=0 left=259 textoff=0 index=3000 top=174 time=200 storage=012e_プールスナップ][fg textoff=0 left=29 index=4000 top=321 time=200 storage=012b_喫茶店スナップ][fg textoff=0 left=459 index=5000 top=347 time=200 storage=012d_橋公園スナップ]Watch a movie, eat lunch...then maybe we'll go to Waterfront Park.[lr]::
40578::$$$message_0274_0018_0003$$$::It would be nice if there was some other excursion spot or theme park, but I can't really think of anything.::
40579::$$$message_0274_0019_0000$$$::"...It's been twenty minutes?"[lr]::
40580::$$$message_0274_0019_0001$$$::...No matter how you look at it, that's a bit too late.[lr]::
40581::$$$message_0274_0019_0002$$$::I'll check with the Emiya house. There might be a message.::
40582::$$$message_0274_0020_0000$$$::"There's a lot fewer pay phones now, they're hard to find..."[lr]::
40583::$$$message_0274_0020_0001$$$::I take hold of the phone booth that I manage to find somehow.::
40584::$$$message_0274_0021_0000$$$::"Hello, Emiya residence."[lr]::
40585::$$$message_0274_0021_0001$$$::"Oh, Sakura? It's me."[lr]::
40586::$$$message_0274_0021_0002$$$::"Huh... Senpai? I thought you were out. Is there something wrong?"::
40587::$$$message_0274_0022_0000$$$::"No, just wanted to check something.[lr]::
40588::$$$message_0274_0022_0001$$$::Is there any word from Tohsaka?"[lr]::
40589::$$$message_0274_0022_0002$$$::"...No, nothing of the sort. Maybe she's still at home?"[lr]::
40590::$$$message_0274_0022_0003$$$::"I see... Got it, thank you."[lr]::
40591::$$$message_0274_0022_0004$$$::I set the receiver down.[lr]::
40592::$$$message_0274_0022_0005$$$::No message from Tohsaka... At this point, I can only try calling her house.::
40593::$$$message_0274_0023_0000$$$::I can think that it's proof that she's out if I don't get ahold of her. Did she have any convenient ways to reach her like a voicemail...? I'm sure she did.[lr]::
40594::$$$message_0274_0023_0001$$$::Even if we miss each other, I can just leave a message there...::
40595::$$$message_0274_0024_0000$$$::"...Hello, this is Tohsaka."[lr]::
40596::$$$message_0274_0024_0001$$$::"...Wait."[lr]::
40597::$$$message_0274_0024_0002$$$::Why is Tohsaka answering the phone?::
40598::$$$message_0274_0025_0000$$$::"Hello, this is Emiya... It's you, right, Tohsaka?"[lr]::
40599::$$$message_0274_0025_0001$$$::"Yes, who else...would pick up the phone here?"[lr]::
40600::$$$message_0274_0025_0002$$$::"That's true, but... Hey, Tohsaka, what time is it over there?"[lr]::
40601::$$$message_0274_0025_0003$$$::"11:25..."[lr]::
40602::$$$message_0274_0025_0004$$$::"We said we were meeting in Shinto at 11, right?"::
40603::$$$message_0274_0026_0000$$$::...I hear a small gasp.[lr]::
40604::$$$message_0274_0026_0001$$$::That's weird... She's breathing a little hard, isn't she...?::
40605::$$$message_0274_0027_0000$$$::"Oh... So my clock wasn't ahead..."[lr]::
40606::$$$message_0274_0027_0001$$$::"Hey, are you okay, Tohsaka? You're acting weird, is there something wrong?"[lr]::
40607::$$$message_0274_0027_0002$$$::"Weird? That's not true, I... Oh..."::
40608::$$$message_0274_0028_0000$$$::I hear something collapse.[playstop time=800 nowait=true][lr]::
40609::$$$message_0274_0028_0001$$$::My stomach area gets cold from worry.::
40610::$$$message_0274_0029_0000$$$::"[shock vmax=20 time=300 count=-2]Tohsaka! Are you okay!?"[lr]::
40611::$$$message_0274_0029_0001$$$::"I'm fine... I just tripped..."[lr]::
40612::$$$message_0274_0029_0002$$$::Tohsaka's voice fades and I hear the echo of a thumping sound.[lr]::
40613::$$$message_0274_0029_0003$$$::The receiver must've fallen from Tohsaka's hand...[se storage=se028 nowait=true]::
40614::$$$message_0274_0030_0000$$$::"Tohsaka! Hey, answer me! What happened!?"[lr]::
40615::$$$message_0274_0030_0001$$$::"........."[lr]::
40616::$$$message_0274_0030_0002$$$::I don't hear anything from the receiver.[lr]::
40617::$$$message_0274_0030_0003$$$::"Hnng."[lr]::
40618::$$$message_0274_0030_0004$$$::I don't know what's going on, but Tohsaka has collapsed at her home. There's no mistake about that.[lr]::
40619::$$$message_0274_0030_0005$$$::I don't want to think about it, but if Tohsaka got attacked by someone[line len=2]::
40620::$$$message_0274_0031_0000$$$::I slam the receiver down and run to the bus stop.[lr]::
40621::$$$message_0274_0031_0001$$$::Before I think about things, my body reacts first.::
40622::$$$message_0274_0032_0000$$$::I put the fare into the fare box in frustration and head to Tohsaka's house at full speed.::
40623::$$$message_0274_0033_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
40624::$$$message_0274_0033_0001$$$::Worst case scenario, should I call an ambulance?[lr]::
40625::$$$message_0274_0033_0002$$$::No, Tohsaka's house is a workshop, so it's not good to have outsiders inside.[lr]::
40626::$$$message_0274_0033_0003$$$::If it's beyond my control, I'll get help from Sakura or Saber.::
40627::$$$message_0274_0034_0000$$$::I run up the hill with big strides.[lr]::
40628::$$$message_0274_0034_0001$$$::I haven't trained enough. I'm about to run out of breath from all this confusion.[lr]::
40629::$$$message_0274_0034_0002$$$::Tohsaka has been acting weird since this morning. Had I noticed at that time, then it wouldn't have turned into this situation...!::
40630::$$$message_0274_0035_0000$$$::"Hrrk..."[lr]::
40631::$$$message_0274_0035_0001$$$::A bad image flashes through my mind.[lr]::
40632::$$$message_0274_0035_0002$$$::"...What am I thinking...!?"[lr]::
40633::$$$message_0274_0035_0003$$$::There's no need for that.[lr]::
40634::$$$message_0274_0035_0004$$$::I just need to run at full speed and check up on her.::
40635::$$$message_0274_0036_0000$$$::I arrive.[shock vmax=15 time=1700 count=5][lr]::
40636::$$$message_0274_0036_0001$$$::"Tohsaka! I'm coming in!"[lr]::
40637::$$$message_0274_0036_0002$$$::I push open the door.[lr]::
40638::$$$message_0274_0036_0003$$$::And Tohsaka...doesn't show up to complain about me being loud.[lr]::
40639::$$$message_0274_0036_0004$$$::I didn't have to break open the door. I get in, as if rolling in through the crack of the open door.::
40640::$$$message_0274_0037_0000$$$::The telephone cord is stretched out, leaving the receiver hanging on the floor.[playstop time=800 nowait=true][lr]::
40641::$$$message_0274_0037_0001$$$::"...Tohsaka."[lr]::
40642::$$$message_0274_0037_0002$$$::For a moment, the red furniture creates the illusion that they're covered in blood. I look for Tohsaka among them.[lr]::
40643::$$$message_0274_0037_0003$$$::...There she is. She was collapsed face up on the sofa in the middle of the room.::
40644::$$$message_0274_0038_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
40645::$$$message_0274_0038_0001$$$::I look to see if there are any wounds or bleeding.[lr]::
40646::$$$message_0274_0038_0002$$$::There are no wounds that stand out, but I need to be careful to not move her in case she hit herself somewhere.[lr]::
40647::$$$message_0274_0038_0003$$$::No, more importantly, is she conscious?::
40648::$$$message_0274_0039_0000$$$::"...Hey, Tohsaka."[lr]::
40649::$$$message_0274_0039_0001$$$::I call out to her timidly.[lr]::
40650::$$$message_0274_0039_0002$$$::I have to continue calling to her in a loud voice until there's a reaction, ensure that her airways are unobstructed and relaxed, and call the ambulance right away...::
40651::$$$message_0274_0040_0000$$$::"...Mm... O-oh?"[lr]::
40652::$$$message_0274_0040_0001$$$::I must've woken her, as Tohsaka shakes her head like she's clearing cobwebs.[lr]::
40653::$$$message_0274_0040_0002$$$::[move textoff=0 opacity=255 base=凛私服10d頬(中) cx=110 storage=凛私服10d頬(中) py=531 px=219 affine=(196,544,3.814,1,200,110,278)(154,575,5.528,1,0,110,278) time=350 cy=278 mag=1 deg=+0.0 accel=2 spline=1][se storage=se215.wav]But, she collapses back on the sofa without energy.[wm canskip=0][movefg textoff=0 opacity=0 left=6 top=604 time=0 accel=0 storage=凛私服10d頬(中)][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=凛私服10a頬(中)]::
40654::$$$message_0274_0041_0000$$$::"Why...are you...here...?"[lr]::
40655::$$$message_0274_0041_0001$$$::"Well, you collapsed in the middle of our call. Don't you remember?"[lr]::
40656::$$$message_0274_0041_0002$$$::"Oh...yeah.[lr]::
40657::$$$message_0274_0041_0003$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服12d頬(中) textoff=0]That's why I tried to go out and came back once...[chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服08b頬(中) textoff=0]I..."::
40658::$$$message_0274_0042_0000$$$::...Her usual spirit is gone.[lr]::
40659::$$$message_0274_0042_0001$$$::As if being overcome by an intense memory lapse, Tohsaka answers unsteadily, faltering between her words.::
40660::$$$message_0274_0043_0000$$$::"Thanks for...coming to get me... We need to leave soon."[lr]::
40661::$$$message_0274_0043_0001$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服12a頬(中) textoff=0][move textoff=0 time=270 path=(149,147,255)(161,159,255)(108,112,255)(91,111,255)(127,86,255)(132,98,255)(159,85,255) storage=凛私服12a頬(中) accel=-1.2 spline=1]Tohsaka tries to get up again, but her arm on the sofa is shaking.[wm canskip=0][lr]::
40662::$$$message_0274_0043_0002$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服13a(中) textoff=0]No, she can't even get up like this.[lr]::
40663::$$$message_0274_0043_0003$$$::I go to Tohsaka's side and put a hand on her forehead.::
40664::$$$message_0274_0044_0000$$$::"...I knew it. You still haven't gotten better, right?"[lr]::
40665::$$$message_0274_0044_0001$$$::Just as I expected, Tohsaka's forehead is hot.[lr]::
40666::$$$message_0274_0044_0002$$$::Her fever's gotten so bad that she'll collapse if she forces herself.[lr]::
40667::$$$message_0274_0044_0003$$$::She's fainted before at school too, so she must not be feeling well. She might've cooled her body even more by sleeping here.::
40668::$$$message_0274_0045_0000$$$::...But, I can finally calm down.[lr]::
40669::$$$message_0274_0045_0001$$$::I bet Tohsaka would get mad if I said it's just a fever, but even then, I'm glad it's not some worse illness or injury...::
40670::$$$message_0274_0046_0000$$$::"...Emiya? Look at you being all motherly..."[play storage=bgm133.ogg][lr]::
40671::$$$message_0274_0046_0001$$$::"Well, I'm glad. I was worried that you might've been attacked by someone until just now."[lr]::
40672::$$$message_0274_0046_0002$$$::"I was fine this morning... [cacheimage storage=凛私服12a頬(近)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服12a頬(近) textoff=0]If I gather my spirit, even I[line len=2]"::
40673::$$$message_0274_0047_0000$$$::Tohsaka tries to get up for the third time.[lr]::
40674::$$$message_0274_0047_0001$$$::She's just like a sick person insisting stubbornly that she's fine.::
40675::$$$message_0274_0048_0000$$$::"What's up with that hunched back? You have a cold, right, Tohsaka?[lr]::
40676::$$$message_0274_0048_0001$$$::Come on, let's cancel our date today."[wm canskip=0][lr]::
40677::$$$message_0274_0048_0002$$$::"But...I can't cancel like this when you invited me."::
40678::$$$message_0274_0049_0000$$$::"Don't worry about that.[lr]::
40679::$$$message_0274_0049_0001$$$::Instead, I'll nurse you today so you won't have to push yourself. That's fine, right?"::
40680::$$$message_0274_0050_0000$$$::Tohsaka is sick, and my plans also depend on her.[lr]::
40681::$$$message_0274_0050_0001$$$::Tohsaka is so stubborn that she might do something reckless at this rate, so it'd be better for me to be by her side.::
40682::$$$message_0274_0051_0000$$$::"Okay. I'll relax for today, so you..."[lr]::
40683::$$$message_0274_0051_0001$$$::"Got it. You can't walk, right? I'll take you to your bedroom."[lr]::
40684::$$$message_0274_0051_0002$$$::I put my hand in between the sofa and Tohsaka's body.[lr]::
40685::$$$message_0274_0051_0003$$$::Just like that time at school, I pick her up.[rep textoff=0 fliplr=0 tops=66 storages=凛私服10c(近) time=100 flipudr=0 lefts=155 indexes=1000]::
40686::$$$message_0274_0052_0000$$$::"W-w-[wvl][shock vmax=20 time=400 count=-4]what are you doing, Shirou!?"[lr]::
40687::$$$message_0274_0052_0001$$$::"I'm carrying you. This isn't the first time or anything."::
40688::$$$message_0274_0053_0000$$$::Before, it was at school and in front of everyone... Thinking back to it, I did something quite embarrassing.[lr]::
40689::$$$message_0274_0053_0001$$$::[shock vmax=25 time=800 count=-3]Compared to that, it's Tohsaka's house where there's no one watching. This is nothing...though I guess I am taking her to her bedroom.::
40690::$$$message_0274_0054_0000$$$::"...Mrgh."[lr]::
40691::$$$message_0274_0054_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
40692::$$$message_0274_0054_0002$$$::I'm like a groom carrying the bride.::
40693::$$$message_0274_0055_0000$$$::"You won't get anything from me even if you make that face, Emiya."[lr]::
40694::$$$message_0274_0055_0001$$$::"No kidding."[lr]::
40695::$$$message_0274_0055_0002$$$::I carry Tohsaka, being careful of my surroundings.[lr]::
40696::$$$message_0274_0055_0003$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服11a頬(近) textoff=0]She must be worried, as she wraps her arms around my neck.[lr]::
40697::$$$message_0274_0055_0004$$$::...Tohsaka's flushed face from her fever makes her look embarrassed, which also makes me nervous.::
40698::$$$message_0274_0056_0000$$$::"Are you okay, Tohsaka?"[lr]::
40699::$$$message_0274_0056_0001$$$::"Mm..."::
40700::$$$message_0274_0057_0000$$$::[clfg textoff=0 time=400 pos=all][se storage=se288.wav][shock vmax=25 time=900 count=3]I gently lay her down.[lr]::
40701::$$$message_0274_0057_0001$$$::I also take her shoes off and line them up at the foot of the bed.[lr]::
40702::$$$message_0274_0057_0002$$$::[splinemove opacity=85 layer=base nospline=1 time=2500 path=(301,300,2.000)(735,300,2.000) storage=i凛の寝室 accel=-1.7]She has her shoes on in the house...as expected from a Western-style house...but putting that all aside...[wsplinemove canskip=0]::
40703::$$$message_0274_0058_0000$$$::"Do you want to sleep here for a while? I think that'll be better if you're not feeling well."[lr]::
40704::$$$message_0274_0058_0001$$$::"...I'll get better right away...if I lie down for a bit..."[lr]::
40705::$$$message_0274_0058_0002$$$::"Is it, um, because of the Magic Crest again?"::
40706::$$$message_0274_0059_0000$$$::She said that was the cause when she fainted at school, but she seems quite different today.[lr]::
40707::$$$message_0274_0059_0001$$$::It must not only be because of her Crest.::
40708::$$$message_0274_0060_0000$$$::"This time, I'm just genuinely not feeling well... I would think I would be able to manage if it was that."[lr]::
40709::$$$message_0274_0060_0001$$$::"You must be tired from returning to Japan... A lot of things happened since you got back, too."::
40710::$$$message_0274_0061_0000$$$::"Ugh... How pathetic of me to faint in front of you twice."[lr]::
40711::$$$message_0274_0061_0001$$$::"It's a blessing in disguise. I'm glad that it was me."[lr]::
40712::$$$message_0274_0061_0002$$$::"...Meaning?"[lr]::
40713::$$$message_0274_0061_0003$$$::"If it were Sakura or Saber, they would be worried to death."::
40714::$$$message_0274_0062_0000$$$::They wouldn't faint from surprise themselves, but it would still get them super worried.[lr]::
40715::$$$message_0274_0062_0001$$$::Tohsaka agrees weakly, with a bitter smile.::
40716::$$$message_0274_0063_0000$$$::"If I fainted in front of Ryudou, he might even finish me off."[lr]::
40717::$$$message_0274_0063_0001$$$::"That's rude. Issei would actually nurse you."[lr]::
40718::$$$message_0274_0063_0002$$$::"He might also chant a sutra. Well, I don't want to reveal such a blunder in front of Shinji."::
40719::$$$message_0274_0064_0000$$$::She's acting strong, yet there's no strength in her voice after all.[lr]::
40720::$$$message_0274_0064_0001$$$::Even just by talking like this, I feel like she's forcing herself to unnecessarily consume energy.::
40721::$$$message_0274_0065_0000$$$::"...You should be sleeping, Tohsaka."[lr]::
40722::$$$message_0274_0065_0001$$$::"I don't need you to tell me that... Emiya, [cacheimage storage=凛私服08b頬(中)][wvl canskip=false time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服08b頬(中) textoff=0]um..."[lr]::
40723::$$$message_0274_0065_0002$$$::Huh?[lr]::
40724::$$$message_0274_0065_0003$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服11a頬(中) textoff=0]Well, even if she looks at me with such a red face…[l][br]Tohsaka is still wearing her regular clothes in bed... I see. If she's going to sleep, she has to change.::
40725::$$$message_0274_0066_0000$$$::"...Should I help you change?"[lr]::
40726::$$$message_0274_0066_0001$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服10c(中) textoff=0]Helping the weakened Tohsaka change.[fg left=94 textoff=0 opacity=0 mono=1 color=0x00e70a0f index=3000 top=99 time=120 storage=凛私服10a頬(中)][lr]::
40727::$$$message_0274_0066_0002$$$::[movefg opacity=187 mono=1 color=0xbbe70a0f left=94 top=99 time=2000 accel=0 storage=凛私服10a頬(中) textoff=0][movefg opacity=0 left=94 top=99 time=2000 accel=0 storage=凛私服10c(中) textoff=0]Even if she's like this, taking her clothes off and changing her is too stimulating. On top of that, Tohsaka can't resist, and it's bad how her being that hot makes her even more appealing...[wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0]::
40728::$$$message_0274_0067_0000$$$::"Wha...[wvl][shock vmax=10 time=400 count=-3]What are you thinking of, Shirou?"[lr]::
40729::$$$message_0274_0067_0001$$$::"Y-yeah, it needs to be a girl for this sort of thing, so I need to call Sakura or someone."[lr]::
40730::$$$message_0274_0067_0002$$$::"..."::
40731::$$$message_0274_0068_0000$$$::She suddenly falls silent.[lr]::
40732::$$$message_0274_0068_0001$$$::Sakura is her little sister, so she should be able to rely on her at least at times like this.::
40733::$$$message_0274_0069_0000$$$::"...It's okay, you don't have to call Sakura.[lr]::
40734::$$$message_0274_0069_0001$$$::I'll just change and wipe off my sweat."[lr]::
40735::$$$message_0274_0069_0002$$$::"That's good... [wvl][shock vmax=15 time=400 count=-3]No, it's not good, ugh, either way, I shouldn't be here."::
40736::$$$message_0274_0070_0000$$$::There's no way it's okay for me to watch Tohsaka changing.[lr]::
40737::$$$message_0274_0070_0001$$$::When I stand from my chair frantically, I make a list in my head of what I need to nurse Tohsaka.::
40738::$$$message_0274_0071_0000$$$::"I-I'll go down and get some ice and a jug."[lr]::
40739::$$$message_0274_0071_0001$$$::"...Yeah, the ice pillow is in the top drawer."::
40740::$$$message_0274_0072_0000$$$::[clfg time=300 rule=シャッター左から pos=all textoff=0]I open the drawer just as I'm told and grab the rubber ice pillow.[lr]::
40741::$$$message_0274_0072_0001$$$::Now I just hope that Tohsaka finishes getting ready while I put ice into this.[lr]::
40742::$$$message_0274_0072_0002$$$::When I look at the clock, it's already past 12 PM.::
40743::$$$message_0274_0073_0000$$$::"...Oh, it's already past noon.[lr]::
40744::$$$message_0274_0073_0001$$$::Tohsaka, do you have any appetite?"[lr]::
40745::$$$message_0274_0073_0002$$$::"A little bit, [cacheimage storage=凛私服11a頬(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服11a頬(中) textoff=0]but fatty stuff is a bit too much..."[lr]::
40746::$$$message_0274_0073_0003$$$::"Then I'll borrow your kitchen and make something quick."::
40747::$$$message_0274_0074_0000$$$::...Now.[lr]::
40748::$$$message_0274_0074_0001$$$::I borrow the kitchen, finish cooking, and come back with the nursing goods.::
40749::$$$message_0274_0075_0000$$$::"I'm coming in, Tohsaka."[lr]::
40750::$$$message_0274_0075_0001$$$::"...Go ahead. I'm done changing."::
40751::$$$message_0274_0076_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
40752::$$$message_0274_0076_0001$$$::I gasp slightly.[lr]::
40753::$$$message_0274_0076_0002$$$::Just pajamas that I've never seen before are making me feel like this.::
40754::$$$message_0274_0077_0000$$$::"...Umm... Let's see, how are you feeling?"[lr]::
40755::$$$message_0274_0077_0001$$$::"I feel a little better.[lr]::
40756::$$$message_0274_0077_0002$$$::That's a lot of stuff."::
40757::$$$message_0274_0078_0000$$$::Nothing I can do about it. I have the ice pillow under my arm and the tray of food in my hands.[lr]::
40758::$$$message_0274_0078_0001$$$::Tohsaka is looking in my direction, sitting in bed.[lr]::
40759::$$$message_0274_0078_0002$$$::...It seems like she's not feeling better yet.::
40760::$$$message_0274_0079_0000$$$::"Here's the ice pillow... Come to think of it, I didn't bring any medicine, but what are you gonna do?"[lr]::
40761::$$$message_0274_0079_0001$$$::"Oh, that's okay. I had my family's specially made medicine."[lr]::
40762::$$$message_0274_0079_0002$$$::Guh. When I hear about Tohsaka's specially made medicine...[lr]::
40763::$$$message_0274_0079_0003$$$::I can't help but think of something like [font italic=true]that.[font italic=false]::
40764::$$$message_0274_0080_0000$$$::"If I take this and rest for about half a day, most of my cold will go away. And if worst comes to worst, the soil here is good for me, so I can go to the basement and[line len=2]"[lr]::
40765::$$$message_0274_0080_0001$$$::"Then, you need nutrients. Can you eat this, Tohsaka?"[lr]::
40766::$$$message_0274_0080_0002$$$::I interrupt her disturbing talk about what she would do in the dirt and take her tray.::
40767::$$$message_0274_0081_0000$$$::Tohsaka is looking at me dubiously, as if her eyes are asking what on earth I made.::
40768::$$$message_0274_0082_0000$$$::"Emiya, what did you make?"[lr]::
40769::$$$message_0274_0082_0001$$$::"Oatmeal."[lr]::
40770::$$$message_0274_0082_0002$$$::As expected, Tohsaka looks disgusted.[lr]::
40771::$$$message_0274_0082_0003$$$::It seems like it's also established within Tohsaka that oatmeal porridge for a sick person is something bad.::
40772::$$$message_0274_0083_0000$$$::"Oof... Could it be Haferflockensuppe?"[lr]::
40773::$$$message_0274_0083_0001$$$::"Are you talking about oat milk porridge? I thought it would taste awful, so I decided against it.[lr]::
40774::$$$message_0274_0083_0002$$$::For now, I made porridge using consommé with turnips and green onions."::
40775::$$$message_0274_0084_0000$$$::I confidently offer Tohsaka a plate.[lr]::
40776::$$$message_0274_0084_0001$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=凛パジャマ_髪下ろし02d頬(中) textoff=0]The light and fragrant smell of consommé comes in a whiff, and it's different from what you would call oatmeal porridge. At first glance, it is unmistakably porridge with assorted grains.::
40777::$$$message_0274_0085_0000$$$::Tohsaka holds her spoon and looks hard at the plate.[lr]::
40778::$$$message_0274_0085_0001$$$::She must either have oatmeal-related trauma or be cautious about food that she's never seen before.[lr]::
40779::$$$message_0274_0085_0002$$$::"Ah... Hm..."::
40780::$$$message_0274_0086_0000$$$::Tohsaka is stealing glances at me, with the spoon in her mouth.::
40781::$$$message_0274_0087_0000$$$::"Mm... It's pretty good..."[lr]::
40782::$$$message_0274_0087_0001$$$::"I made it on the spot though. It's not as nourishing as milk porridge, but...it seems like it's good for digestion."::
40783::$$$message_0274_0088_0000$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=凛パジャマ_髪下ろし02h頬(中) textoff=0]We poke at the oatmeal porridge together.[lr]::
40784::$$$message_0274_0088_0001$$$::What a lunch date this has become.[lr]::
40785::$$$message_0274_0088_0002$$$::Well, having homemade porridge in her bedroom is more relaxing than eating at a restaurant in Shinto.::
40786::$$$message_0274_0089_0000$$$::"...Fine. I'll approve of your cooking skills just this time.[lr]::
40787::$$$message_0274_0089_0001$$$::You just watch, I'm going to leave you speechless when you're sick next time."[lr]::
40788::$$$message_0274_0089_0002$$$::"...With an oatmeal dish?"::
40789::$$$message_0274_0090_0000$$$::"Forget oatmeal. With Chinese food that's been fed to the sick for three thousand years, and a balanced diet leading to a healthy body, I'll make you...[cacheimage storage=凛パジャマ_髪下ろし02g頬(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=凛パジャマ_髪下ろし02g頬(中) textoff=0]ahh..."::
40790::$$$message_0274_0091_0000$$$::I figured she'd get excited from burning with revenge.[lr]::
40791::$$$message_0274_0091_0001$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=凛パジャマ_髪下ろし02h頬(中) textoff=0]Tohsaka sets her spoon down onto her almost empty plate. I guess it was too much.::
40792::$$$message_0274_0092_0000$$$::"...Thank you for the food, Emiya."[lr]::
40793::$$$message_0274_0092_0001$$$::"No problem. Well, sorry for using your kitchen and ingredients without asking."[lr]::
40794::$$$message_0274_0092_0002$$$::"It's fine. I'm the one who got treated..."::
40795::$$$message_0274_0093_0000$$$::I put away the dishes and sit by her bed.[lr]::
40796::$$$message_0274_0093_0001$$$::...Now, I want a post-meal drink.[lr]::
40797::$$$message_0274_0093_0002$$$::"I'll go pour some tea. I'll borrow your kitchen again, Tohsaka."[lr]::
40798::$$$message_0274_0093_0003$$$::"Oh, then can you make me some chamomile tea, Emiya?"::
40799::$$$message_0274_0094_0000$$$::I nod and get up, holding the dishes.[lr]::
40800::$$$message_0274_0094_0001$$$::I work more briskly when Tohsaka is the one I'm nursing...no, I guess it doesn't change much from what I usually do.[lr]::
40801::$$$message_0274_0094_0002$$$::Just from the fact that Tohsaka has a cold, my state of mind is completely different.[lr]::
40802::$$$message_0274_0094_0003$$$::It's like my paternal instinct comes out, or maybe it's because Tohsaka is cute when she's weak...::
40803::$$$message_0274_0095_0000$$$::"...If she had a cold like this forever... No, that's not good."[lr]::
40804::$$$message_0274_0095_0001$$$::A meek Tohsaka isn't good after all.::
40805::$$$message_0274_0096_0000$$$::"...If she's having chamomile tea, she's probably going to rest."[lr]::
40806::$$$message_0274_0096_0001$$$::I remember the herb knowledge that I was taught and choose a light blue tea cup.[lr]::
40807::$$$message_0274_0096_0002$$$::Once Tohsaka sleeps, I'll have Sakura come over. I feel like there would be a lot of obstacles for me as a guy once it becomes nighttime.::
40808::$$$message_0274_0097_0000$$$::"...I'm coming in, Tohsaka..."[lr]::
40809::$$$message_0274_0097_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
40810::$$$message_0274_0097_0002$$$::Tohsaka must be dozing off, as there's no answer.[lr]::
40811::$$$message_0274_0097_0003$$$::When I slowly open the door, there's Tohsaka with a flushed face...is she getting worse?::
40812::$$$message_0274_0098_0000$$$::"Oh... Emiya, thank you."[lr]::
40813::$$$message_0274_0098_0001$$$::"Here... You're going to rest once you have a drink, right? I'll stay with you until then."[lr]::
40814::$$$message_0274_0098_0002$$$::I'll watch over her until she falls asleep... If I told the usual Tohsaka this, she would laugh at me.::
40815::$$$message_0274_0099_0000$$$::Tohsaka drinks her herb tea.[lr]::
40816::$$$message_0274_0099_0001$$$::...She's weakened from a cold right now, but I'm sure she'll be back to the usual invincible, confident, and energetic Tohsaka.[lr]::
40817::$$$message_0274_0099_0002$$$::"...Too bad."[lr]::
40818::$$$message_0274_0099_0003$$$::"You like ladylike girls, don't you?"::
40819::$$$message_0274_0100_0000$$$::...Tohsaka's sharp remark jabs my unprotected sides.[lr]::
40820::$$$message_0274_0100_0001$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=凛パジャマ_髪下ろし02m頬(中) textoff=0]As expected of her; even if she looks weaker, Tohsaka is still Tohsaka. ::
40821::$$$message_0274_0101_0000$$$::"You're soft when it comes to those kinds of girly girls like Sakura or Illya. [cacheimage storage=凛パジャマ_髪下ろし02h頬(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=凛パジャマ_髪下ろし02h頬(中) textoff=0]Is it your paternal instinct?"[lr]::
40822::$$$message_0274_0101_0001$$$::"...That's normal. But, I prefer the usual you over the you right now."::
40823::$$$message_0274_0102_0000$$$::I honestly tell her what's on my mind.[lr]::
40824::$$$message_0274_0102_0001$$$::Ladylike...but more than that, I can't be happy about someone being sick.[lr]::
40825::$$$message_0274_0102_0002$$$::Even if she gets better and pushes me around, I would be happy if that was a healthy Tohsaka.::
40826::$$$message_0274_0103_0000$$$::"Hmm, so you're satisfied with that, Emiya."[lr]::
40827::$$$message_0274_0103_0001$$$::Tohsaka is looking over at me with her face slightly flushed still.[lr]::
40828::$$$message_0274_0103_0002$$$::I was enjoying the gentle aroma of herb tea in my mouth in the silent room.::
40829::$$$message_0274_0104_0000$$$::"...I see, then I need to get better tomorrow and hang out with you again."[lr]::
40830::$$$message_0274_0104_0001$$$::"Well, if you're fine with me.[lr]::
40831::$$$message_0274_0104_0002$$$::...Don't worry me like today, though. It's bad for my heart."::
40832::$$$message_0274_0105_0000$$$::"Yeah, I owe you one again now...[cacheimage storage=凛パジャマ_髪下ろし02b頬(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=凛パジャマ_髪下ろし02b頬(中) textoff=0]that's not good, I have to use my favors wisely."::
40833::$$$message_0274_0106_0000$$$::[clfg time=300 pos=all]Time continues to pass as we both sip on our tea. This sure makes me sleepy... I feel like Tohsaka's herbs are oddly strong...::
40834::$$$message_0274_0107_0000$$$::"Ahh... Emiya, thanks...a lot for today."[lr]::
40835::$$$message_0274_0107_0001$$$::"Don't worry. I won't force you to pay me back.[lr]::
40836::$$$message_0274_0107_0002$$$::...You're gonna rest, right?"[lr]::
40837::$$$message_0274_0107_0003$$$::"Yeah."::
40838::$$$message_0274_0108_0000$$$::[clfg time=300 textoff=0 rule=シャッター左から pos=all][se storage=se288.wav]I stand up and put a blanket over Tohsaka.[lr]::
40839::$$$message_0274_0108_0001$$$::Tohsaka's side profile looks over here.[lr]::
40840::$$$message_0274_0108_0002$$$::At a glance, I feel like Tohsaka's eyes have a downcast look.::
40841::$$$message_0274_0109_0000$$$::"...What's wrong, Tohsaka?"[lr]::
40842::$$$message_0274_0109_0001$$$::"Well... I asked you to do a lot of things today, but[fadein time=400 storage=fd26 textoff=0 cleardash=1]...this is my last request."[wdash canskip=0]::
40843::$$$message_0274_0110_0000$$$::My heart beats fast from her words.[lr]::
40844::$$$message_0274_0110_0001$$$::Tohsaka whispers, blushing on the bed.::
40845::$$$message_0274_0111_0000$$$::"...Well, I'll do anything if it's your last."[lr]::
40846::$$$message_0274_0111_0001$$$::"Then...give me a good night kiss."[wsplinemove canskip=0]::
40847::$$$message_0274_0112_0000$$$::Oh, so it's that.[lr]::
40848::$$$message_0274_0112_0001$$$::A good night kiss is one where you lightly kiss the cheek or forehead. I would listen to anything[line len=2]wait, me...kissing Tohsaka...?::
40849::$$$message_0274_0113_0000$$$::"Well... Are you sure?"[lr]::
40850::$$$message_0274_0113_0001$$$::"I mean... I might have kissed you before, but you haven't kissed me yet."[lr]::
40851::$$$message_0274_0113_0002$$$::"...Well, that's true."::
40852::$$$message_0274_0114_0000$$$::When Tohsaka kisses me, it often feels like a surprise attack or an assault. That's why me kissing her is rare... My heart is pounding so much it hurts.::
40853::$$$message_0274_0115_0000$$$::It doesn't make me more nervous than magecraft.[lr]::
40854::$$$message_0274_0115_0001$$$::It's not like I would die even if I messed up... Well, it's not like I'll mess up.[lr]::
40855::$$$message_0274_0115_0002$$$::But if I kiss Tohsaka, then I feel like I might die.::
40856::$$$message_0274_0116_0000$$$::"...Fine... Here I come."[lr]::
40857::$$$message_0274_0116_0001$$$::I can't help but stiffen up.[lr]::
40858::$$$message_0274_0116_0002$$$::I get weirdly nervous and can't move my body smoothly.::
40859::$$$message_0274_0117_0000$$$::At this point, I should just close my eyes...and touch Tohsaka somewhere with my lips.[lr]::
40860::$$$message_0274_0117_0001$$$::Even if I kiss her on the lips.::
40861::$$$message_0274_0118_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
40862::$$$message_0274_0118_0001$$$::I open my eyes slightly in the dark.[lr]::
40863::$$$message_0274_0118_0002$$$::I bring my lips close to Tohsaka's face, so nervous that I'm about to suffocate.::
40864::$$$message_0274_0119_0000$$$::"Mm..."[lr]::
40865::$$$message_0274_0119_0001$$$::I come into contact with soft and slightly sweaty skin.[lr]::
40866::$$$message_0274_0119_0002$$$::I pull away from her right away. I won't be able to handle it if I continue kissing Tohsaka.::
40867::$$$message_0274_0120_0000$$$::"...I did it, Tohsaka."[lr]::
40868::$$$message_0274_0120_0001$$$::"...That was a 65."[wm canskip=0][lr]::
40869::$$$message_0274_0120_0002$$$::[font italic=true]What!?[font italic=false][lr]::
40870::$$$message_0274_0120_0003$$$::Tohsaka, who lifts her face up, gives me a super strict score.::
40871::$$$message_0274_0121_0000$$$::"You can't have your eyes closed, I was wondering where you were going to kiss me at first.[lr]::
40872::$$$message_0274_0121_0001$$$::And if you bring your face so close to mine like that, it'll make me anxious."::
40873::$$$message_0274_0122_0000$$$::"You're also shaking too."[lr]::
40874::$$$message_0274_0122_0001$$$::"...Maybe. It was the first time."::
40875::$$$message_0274_0123_0000$$$::...That meant it was the first time that I kissed her.[lr]::
40876::$$$message_0274_0123_0001$$$::I hold back my urge to rub my lips with my fingers. I feel like the taste of Tohsaka is still left on my lips.::
40877::$$$message_0274_0124_0000$$$::"...C'mon, you're completely better now. All that worry was for nothing."[lr]::
40878::$$$message_0274_0124_0001$$$::"It seems like teasing you was a bit of a boost... [fadein time=400 storage=fd26b textoff=0]Good night, Emiya.[lr]::
40879::$$$message_0274_0124_0002$$$::Try aiming for a higher score next time."::
40880::$$$message_0274_0125_0000$$$::She laughs at me while lying down.[lr]::
40881::$$$message_0274_0125_0001$$$::...Well, you know.[lr]::
40882::$$$message_0274_0125_0002$$$::This is why I can't beat Tohsaka.::
40883::$$$message_0274_0126_0000$$$::"All right, I'll come back again after I do the dishes."[lr]::
40884::$$$message_0274_0126_0001$$$::"I'll rest until the evening, so you can go home. You don't have to force yourself to stay."[lr]::
40885::$$$message_0274_0126_0002$$$::"No. If it's inconvenient, I'll call Saber or Sakura over in the evening."::
40886::$$$message_0274_0127_0000$$$::Tohsaka says it's fine.[lr]::
40887::$$$message_0274_0127_0001$$$::Based on her current state, there's no doubt she'll get better once she rests.[lr]::
40888::$$$message_0274_0127_0002$$$::While Tohsaka is dozing off, I add,::
40889::$$$message_0274_0128_0000$$$::"...That kiss doesn't count towards who owes who."[lr]::
40890::$$$message_0274_0128_0001$$$::"It's fine, you helped me a lot today since I had sick person privileges[fadein time=400 storage=fd26d textoff=0][line len=2]Next time."::
40891::$$$message_0274_0129_0000$$$::Tohsaka's breathing goes quiet.[lr]::
40892::$$$message_0274_0129_0001$$$::She went to sleep...or maybe she's pretending to sleep to put me at ease. I stand up, look back at Tohsaka, and head to the kitchen.::
40893::$$$message_0274_0130_0000$$$::I ended up staying in Tohsaka's living room until the evening.[lr]::
40894::$$$message_0274_0130_0001$$$::I left a note saying to call me if anything happens.::
40895::$$$message_0274_0131_0000$$$::"Good night, Tohsaka. See you tomorrow[line len=2]or even tonight."[lr]::
40896::$$$message_0274_0131_0001$$$::I say to Tohsaka and leave her house.[lr]::
40897::$$$message_0274_0131_0002$$$::I hope next time will be a normal date without any accidents like this.:p<�